s/fanout-run.cjs:2973-3049\",\".dsh/SYNC.md:105-111\",\".dsh/README.md:59-67\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/017-dsh-rc3-repin/research/fanout-rc3/lineages/dsh-rc3/invocation-metadata.json:1\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/004-dsh-runtime-folder-and-patches/tasks.md:45-46\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T17:17:03.261Z\",\"durationMs\":35756}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"The LLM Gateway route patch configures provider llmgateway (display name LLM Gateway) with apiKeyEnv LLMGATEWAY_API_KEY, api openai-completions, baseURL https://api.llmgateway.io/v1, and compat thinkingFormat deepseek with supportsDeveloperRole false.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml:7\",\".dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml:9\",\".dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml:11\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"label\":\"The LLM Gateway route patch declares model id deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 (name DeepSeek V4.1 Flash) with reasoning efforts off (empty), high and max, and pins agent-default-model to provider llmgateway, model deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017, reasoningEffort max.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml:14\",\".dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml:16\",\".dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml:24\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"label\":\"The OpenCode Go route patch configures provider opencode-go (display name OpenCode Go) with apiKeyEnv OPENCODE_API_KEY, api openai-completions, baseURL https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1, and the same compat block; its header records the endpoint as unverified until a keyed run proves it.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml:2\",\".dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml:7\",\".dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml:10\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"label\":\"The OpenCode Go route patch declares model id deepseek-v4.1-flash (name DeepSeek V4.1 Flash) with reasoning efforts off (empty), high and max, and pins agent-default-model to provider opencode-go, model deepseek-v4.1-flash, reasoningEffort max.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml:15\",\".dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml:17\",\".dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml:25\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"label\":\"Route selection is model-driven: deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 selects route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml while every other allowlisted model selects route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml; the selected patch is passed to dsh --patch with the lineage patch and the reasoning effort is pinned per model. This lineage records model deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 at reasoningEffort max, so the LLM Gateway route is active here.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3006\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3015\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/017-dsh-rc3-repin/research/fanout-rc3/lineages/dsh-rc3/invocation-metadata.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"label\":\"Independent documentation agrees with the patch text: .dsh/SYNC.md expects agent-default-model naming llmgateway + deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 for the LLM Gateway route and opencode-go + deepseek-v4.1-flash for the OpenCode Go route, while .dsh/README.md names LLMGATEWAY_API_KEY and OPENCODE_API_KEY as the two route credentials.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".dsh/SYNC.md:111\",\".dsh/README.md:67\"]}\n","file_path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/388-dsh-rc3-repin/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/017-dsh-rc3-re