_complete` event in the state log is an event row with `event: synthesis_complete`. The reducer's `collectDeltaIterationRecords` etc. won't consider it an iteration. Fine.\n\nAnother potential issue: The parent merge might need a `deep-research-dashboard.md` with specific sections; the reducer generated it. Let me inspect the top of the dashboard.\n\nAlso, check the registry has 6 keyFindings and 4 resolved. Done.\n\nNow, one thing: the iteration record was appended *before* the delta file existed, and the reducer merged. Good. But the gateway event was recorded at 17:17:03 while the narrative file was written at ~17:16:5x. Fine.\n\nLet me run verification checks:\n- JSON parse config/registry/delta/state log.\n- count iteration rows in state log = 1; synthesis_complete = 1.\n- delta first line type iteration and findingsCount 6; 6 finding rows; each finding has sources.\n- iteration file has headings Focus, Findings, Sources Consulted, Assessment, Reflection, Recommended Next Focus, Ruled Out, Dead Ends, Edge Cases.\n- research.md has Eliminated Alternatives and Divergence Map before \"## 12. Open Questions\".\n- config.status == complete; lineage.sessionId correct.\n- list writes vs expected.\n\nLet me write a node verification script inline (no file) and run."}
{"type":"tool_call","callId":"chatcmpl-tool-bc9c6bc20ba6c823","tool":"bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/388-dsh-rc3-repin/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/017-dsh-rc3-repin/research/fanout-rc3/lineages/dsh-rc3 && node -e '\nconst fs = require(\"fs\");\nconst out = {};\nconst config = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(\"deep-research-config.json\",\"utf8\"));\nout.configStatus = config.status;\nout.sessionId = config.lineage.sessionId;\nout.maxIterations = config.maxIterations;\nconst state = fs.readFileSync(\"deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"utf8\").trim().split(/\\n/).map(JSON.parse);\nout.stateRows = state.length;\nout.iterationRows = state.filter(r=>r.type===\"iteration\").length;\nout.iteration1Rows = state.filter(r=>r.type===\"iteration\" && r.iteration===1).length;\nout.synthesisRows = state.filter(r=>r.type===\"event\" && r.event===\"synthesis_complete\").length;\nconst delta = fs.readFileSync(\"deltas/iter-001.jsonl\",\"utf8\").trim().split(/\\n/).map(JSON.parse);\nout.deltaRows = delta.length;\nout.deltaFirstType = delta[0].type;\nout.deltaFindingsCount = delta[0].findingsCount;\nout.deltaFindingRows = delta.filter(r=>r.type===\"finding\").length;\nout.deltaFindingsWithSources = delta.filter(r=>r.type===\"finding\" && Array.isArray(r.sources) && r.sources.length>0).length;\nconst registry = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(\"findings-registry.json\",\"utf8\"));\nout.registryKeyFindings = registry.keyFindings.length;\nout.registryResolved = registry.resolvedQuestions.length;\nout.registryOpen = registry.openQuestions.length;\nout.registryIterations = registry.metrics.iterationsCompleted;\nconst iter = fs.readFileSync(\"iterations/iteration-001.md\",\"utf8\");\nout.iterHas = [\"## Focus\",\"## Findings\",\"## Ruled Out\",\"## Dead Ends\",\"## Edge Cases\",\"## Sources Consulted\",\"## Assessment\",\"## Reflection\",\"## Recommended Next Focus\"].filter(h=>iter.includes(h));\nout.iterFindingLines = (iter.match(/^\\d+\\.\\s+/gm)||[]).length;\nout.iterSourceTags = (iter.match(/\\[SOURCE:/g)||[]).length;\nconst research = fs.readFileSync(\"research.md\",\"utf8\");\nconst eliminated = research.indexOf(\"## Eliminated Alternatives\");\nconst divergence = research.indexOf(\"## Divergence Map\");\nconst openQ = research.indexOf(\"## 12. Open Questions\");\nout.researchSectionsOrdered = eliminated > -1 && divergence > eliminated && openQ > divergence;\nout.researchSourceTags = (research.match(/\\[SOURCE:/g)||[]).length;\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(out,null,2));\n'","description":"Verify artifact structure and counts"}}
